    "path": "skills/generate-credit-memo/SKILL.md",
    "body": "# Generate Credit Memo\n\nGenerates a structured credit memo following DBS internal templates, suitable for credit committee review.\n\n## Usage\n\nProvide the applicant's profile document and select a risk tier. The skill outputs a formatted memo covering applicant summary, credit assessment, and a recommendation.\n\n## Inputs\n\n| Input | Type | Required | Notes |\n|-------|------|----------|-------|\n| `applicant_profile` | File (PDF or DOCX) | Yes | Standard DBS applicant profile form |\n| `risk_tier` | `low` / `medium` / `high` | Yes | Pre-assessed risk classification |\n\n## Example output\n\n```\nCREDIT MEMO — DBS Consumer Banking\n===================================\nDate: 2026-04-14\nRisk Tier: Medium\n\nAPPLICANT SUMMARY\nName: ...  |  ID: ...  |  Employment: ...  |  Income: ...\n\nCREDIT ASSESSMENT\n[Summary of credit history, risk factors, and mitigants]\n\nRECOMMENDATION\nApprove — subject to standard medium-risk conditions.\n\nNOTES FOR REVIEWER\nNo anomalies detected. Verify income figure against payslip.\n```\n\n## Caveats\n\n- Output is a draft; a credit officer must review before submission to the credit committee.\n- Data sensitivity is `confidential` — handle outputs per DBS data classification policy."
