    "path": "skills/kyc-document-check/SKILL.md",
    "body": "# KYC Document Check\n\nCompares a submitted identity document against the customer's on-file record and DBS KYC field requirements. Outputs a pass/flag verdict with a structured list of discrepancies.\n\n## Usage\n\nUpload the scanned identity document and the customer's existing record. The skill checks name, date of birth, document number, expiry date, and address fields.\n\n## Inputs\n\n| Input | Type | Required | Notes |\n|-------|------|----------|-------|\n| `identity_document` | File (image or PDF) | Yes | Passport, NRIC, or equivalent |\n| `customer_record` | File (JSON or PDF) | Yes | Existing DBS customer record |\n\n## Output\n\n```\nKYC CHECK RESULT\n================\nStatus: FLAGGED\n\nDiscrepancies:\n  - Name mismatch: document \"TAN WEI MING\", record \"Tan Wei Ming Jr.\"\n  - Expiry: document expires 2026-06-01 (< 6 months)\n\nFields verified (no issues):\n  - Date of birth\n  - Document number\n  - Address\n```\n\n## Caveats\n\n- Beta maturity — output must be reviewed by a compliance officer before any onboarding decision.\n- Restricted data sensitivity — outputs must not leave the compliance team channel."
